correction('P001221','654, endpoint condition',r'\(\lim u^{-1/2}\varphi=\lim u^{1/2}\varphi'+'\''+r'\)',r'No unique emendation without the angular mode and extension','For phi=a sqrt(u)+b sqrt(u)log(u), finite limits force b=0 and their equality then forces a=0. Not the standard exclusion of the logarithmic branch.','ambiguity')
